  "cli.usage-app-cli.wait_invalid": "Use --wait-ms 1..600000 with a live query. Cached, watched and fixed queries cannot wait or rebuild.",
  "cli.usage-app-cli.help": "Wombat\n\nUsage\n  wombat                         Print usage text (same as usage)\n  wombat api [--method METHOD]   Read Agent methods or a request schema\n  wombat call                    Execute one structured request from stdin\n  wombat web                    Start local Web\n  wombat optimize                View and review configuration suggestions\n  wombat optimize inventory      Inspect configuration and usage evidence\n  wombat optimize handoff        Review and send recommendations to local Codex\n  wombat account [refresh|history]       Read Codex account, allowance and activity\n  wombat prices [update]         View / update official prices online\n  wombat refresh                 Refresh local records\n  wombat usage                   View usage\n  wombat threads                 View tasks\n  wombat turns --thread ID        View turns\n  wombat steps --thread ID --turn ID  View turn records\n\nOptions\n  --lang zh|en                   UI and text language (or WOMBAT_LANG)\n  --fresh                        Wait for synchronization (up to 10 seconds)\n  --wait-ms 1..600000             Wait once with a caller deadline; implies --fresh\n  --rebuild                      Rebuild the usage index; preserve user records\n  --include-history              Include historical files in synchronization\n  --cached                       Read committed data only\n  --watch                        Follow updates; --json produces NDJSON\n  --verify                       Verify all source logs (refresh only)\n  --json                         Output JSON\n  --compact                      Bound JSON quality details; retain totals and page\n  --snapshot ID                  Query a fixed snapshot\n  --timezone ZONE                Time zone for display and filtering\n  --since YYYY-MM-DD             Start date (inclusive)\n  --until YYYY-MM-DD             End date (exclusive)\n  --model ID --effort LEVEL       Model and reasoning effort\n  --project PATH                 Historical working directory\n  --project-unknown              Unknown directory attribution\n  --agent ID --source ID         Agent and source instance\n  --locate-thread ID             Locate a task page\n  --matched-only                 Show matching turns only (turns)\n  --locate-turn ID               Locate a turn page (turns)\n  --model-unknown --effort-unknown  Filter unknown model or effort\n  --all-time                     All dates, including undated records\n  --undated                      Filter records with unknown dates; excludes --all-time and date ranges\n  --thread ID                    Limit to a task\n  --group day|week|month          Usage period\n  --presentation distribution|details|projects|models  Usage presentation\n  --sort tokens|cost|recent|time       Sort order\n  --search TEXT                  Search tasks\n  --limit 1..500 --offset N       Pagination\n  --root PATH                    Source directory; repeatable\n  --version                      Show version\n  --help                         Show help\n",
